  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00042",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "有没有瞧见凶器？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Did you see any weapon?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00042",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "什么都没看见。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I saw nothing at all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00042",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "就在近旁的一颗杉树下看见一根绳子。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I saw a rope under a cedar tree close by.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00042",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "对了——除此之外还有一把梳子。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Oh yes, besides that there was also a comb.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00042",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "尸体附近只有这两件物品。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Those were the only two things near the body.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00042",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "不过周围的竹叶和草丛，踩踏痕迹明显，可以想象被害的男人死前和歹徒有过殊死拼搏。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "However, the bamboo leaves and grass around the area were clearly trampled, so one can imagine that before he died the murdered man fought desperately with the criminal.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00042",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "有没有马？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Was there a horse?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00042",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "不可能有马，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There could not have been a horse,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00042",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "那地方容不下马进去，竹林后面倒是有条路能够供马行走。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "that place was too narrow for a horse to enter, though behind the bamboo grove there was a road a horse could travel on.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
